# Departments, agencies and public bodies finder

A household has no government departments, so this variant becomes an integration or equipment-provider directory. Group results by the configured integration or service, and keep them apart from individual devices and entities. A provider logo shows who made something, not that they support it. Scope, result count, empty states, focus and the no-JavaScript fallback follow the [shared finder behaviour](../finder.html#finder-shared-contract).

## When to use it

Use it for an integration or equipment-provider directory. Group by the configured integration or service, and keep it separate from individual entities and devices.

## Home Assistant boundary

No government organisation is represented or implied. A provider logo does not establish affiliation, support or device capability. Use the integration’s own metadata and approved artwork.

